title: "MOWOA for Indonesian Extractive Summarization (IndoSum)"
abstract: >-
  Code, configuration and text-free results for the Master's thesis
  "Multi-Objective Whale Optimization Algorithm (MOWOA) for Extractive Text
  Summarization" and the ICOT 2026 paper "Indonesian News Text Summarization
  using Multi Objective Whale Optimization Algorithm".
